Changes from the Grok Build plugin: the Grok-specific CLI layer was replaced
by a provider adapter interface, adapters were written for the Cursor, Devin,
GitHub Copilot, Antigravity and Warp Oz CLIs, read-only runs gained a git
working-tree check, the Grok-only session import was removed, and one plugin
per provider is generated from the shared runtime.

